/home/yixunhu/.codex/sessions/2026/09/26/rollout-2026-09-26T17-38-09-01a0dfa7-77ae-7b52-839b-bcc58738f2e6.jsonl:94:{"timestamp":"2026-09-26T21:39:21.142Z","ordinal":93,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0dfa7-77ae-7b52-839b-bcc58738f2e6","turn_id":"01a0dfa7-77ce-7782-ac15-668bcbd12958","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0a5ced22b9ce7e77016ab83b82860487d1bd8c3ed21fdaf73e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"No remaining blocker found in Metric 1, Griffin–Lim treatment, conditioning P, or cross-family claim scope. V3 appropriately limits acoustic comparability, distinguishes T60 normalizations, and scopes results to the fixed checkpoint/reference/phase protocol.\n\n1. **Nit — Incorrect API attribution for `log_mse`.** [Plan line 34](/home/yixunhu/codespace/xRIR_code/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_10_yaw_pilot_claude/plan_yaw_pilot.md:34) attributes `log_mse` to `per_sample_losses`, but that function returns only loss/STFT/decay ([implementation](/home/yixunhu/codespace/xRIR_code/tools/per_sample_metrics.py:58)). **Minimal fix:** Specify exp_03’s separate formula, `mean((out[...,0] − log(tgt_spec[:,0]+1e−8))²)`, or reuse its [spectral_metrics](/home/yixunhu/codespace/xRIR_code/eval_yaw_rotation.py:128), retaining the target spectrum from the model forward.\n\n2. **Nit — Stale pin-verification heading.** [Section 5’s heading](/home/yixunhu/codespace/xRIR_code/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_10_yaw_pilot_claude/plan_yaw_pilot.md:45) still attributes live pin verification to the existing test suite, although [section 7](/home/yixunhu/codespace/xRIR_code/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_10_yaw_pilot_claude/plan_yaw_pilot.md:82) correctly explains that suite’s limitation and requires `verify_exp03_pins`. **Minimal fix:** Update the heading to reference the explicit live-hash comparison.\n\nMethod-scope verdict: **APPROVE WITH CHANGES** (minor specification corrections only)."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1790458754564,"completed_at_ms":1790458761142}}
